# Fabrica run history

This is a retro bundle, made by `fabrica runs export` on 2026-10-17 10:04 (UTC+02:00). It holds 8 runs of every factory (acme, personal), read from this machine's run history ($FABRICA_HOME/runs.db), the ones that started since 2026-09-17 10:04, newest first.

Read this file first. `runs/<run_id>.md` has one run in full, the same as `fabrica runs show`, and `runs.json` has all of them as JSON, for programs. Transcripts aren't copied into the bundle: it only points at them.

